 ("Це найкраща пісня.",["It's the best song"],"It's the best song."),
 ("What is the biggest city in your country?","Київ. Що відповісти?",["Kyiv is the biggest city.","Kyiv is biggest the city.","Kyiv is the most big city."],"Kyiv is the biggest city."),
